  {
   "id": "before-i-go-283988@1.1.1",
   "gameId": "before-i-go-283988",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-24T14:00:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thank you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The support for BEFORE I GO has been far beyond anything I expected. From the Steam reviews to the messages, videos, streams, and playthroughs I've seen, it's been amazing to watch people experience the game and enjoy it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm incredibly grateful for all the support you've shown since launch, and I wanted to take a moment to say thank you before getting into this first update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main addition in version 1.1.1 is the ability to see your completion percentage for each biome.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When opening the map, you'll now find the completion percentage for the selected biome displayed at the top of the screen. This has been a recurring request from the community, and it should make hunting down those last missing collectibles a lot easier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This version also includes a few bug fixes and improvements :",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bad respawn point in the Echoing Veil (out-of-bounds near the 4th boss).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Dash Evade going through walls near angled ceilings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix attempt for multi-switch doors that don't open.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor map update to help locate a collectible in Memorium Peaks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope you enjoy the update, and as always, feel free to share your feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2715870/Before_I_Go/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
