  {
   "id": "before-i-go-283988@1.0.6",
   "gameId": "before-i-go-283988",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-07T15:43:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I want BEFORE I GO to deliver the best experience to players, and this is possible thanks to your continuous feedback on the demo coming my way. This is priceless to me, especially as a solo developer. So thanks you all for your support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There's a lot going on at the minute, and I can't wait to share some more exciting news with you next week 01.13, so stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the meantime, here come the 1.0.6 demo update. For the most part, it addresses some Resurrection Point mechanics shortcomings as well as improving the overall gameplay and usability experience (Detailed release notes bellow).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Talk to you soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Stability",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed crash when rebinding keyboard input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed losing save data when rushing to load a save slot",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "No money loss on death anymore (unfair penalty for casual players)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced first shop item cost",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resurrection Point are now permanent until reaching a regular checkpoint",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crystal costs rebalanced (Watchstone Relic boosts and Resurrection Points)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More reliable main character navigation and collisions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some wall jump inconsistencies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better character navigation on ledge corners",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Displaying NPCs and Architects names",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some minor LD tweaks from playtest feedback (spikes position, platform length, obstructing environment objects)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the AIFlyingGunner projectile aiming and angle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full health when unlocking a new ability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elevation Relics now behave the same as regular checkpoints",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Usability",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Generator switches glint when activated in the correct order",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New tips / tutorials panel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
